<title>NETHERLANDS: Unilever 1996 full-yr net NLG 4.22 billion.</title>
<headline>Unilever 1996 full-yr net NLG 4.22 billion.</headline>
<dateline>ROTTERDAM 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full-year 1996.</p>
<p>(millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (guilders)	  15.00   vs   13.26</p>
<p>    Net profit/current exchange rates     4,215  vs    3,725</p>
<p>    Net profit/constant exchange rates    4,115  vs    3,725</p>
<p>    Net profit excl. exceptional items    4,590  vs    4,053</p>
<p>    Turnover				     87,795  vs   79,703</p>
<p>    Operating profit incl. exceptionals   7,528  vs    6,389</p>
<p>    Operating profit excl. exceptionals   8,148  vs    6,974</p>
<p>NOTES - Full-year figures are stated at current exchange rates for each period unless otherwise indicated.</p>
<p>Dutch analysts had forecast a full-year net profit of 3,870 to 4,210 million guilders with a consensus of 4,094 million.</p>
<p>Unilever said for the full year there were exceptional credits of 280 million guilders which were used to fund restructuring of 888 million guilders, while maintaining net exceptional items in operating profit at the 1995 level.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
